{"t":"V","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Visa Inc.","ko":"비자","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","employees":34800,"hq":"San Francisco, CA, United States","website":"https://corporate.visa.com","summary_en":"Visa Inc. operates as a payments technology company in the United States and internationally. It operates VisaNet, a transaction processing network that enables authorization, clearing, and settlement of payment transactions. The company also offers credit, debit, and prepaid card products; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, a platform which facilitates money movement, enabling clients to collect, hold, convert, and send funds across its network; and issuing solutions, such as airport lounge access, dining reservations, shopping experiences, event tickets, and seller offers. In addition, it provides acceptance solutions, an omnichannel payment integration with e-commerce platforms; risk detection and prevention solutions; and advisory and other services comprising consulting practice, proprietary analytics models, data scientists and economists, marketing services, and managed services. The company provides its services under the Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink, and PLUS brands. It serves consumers, sellers, financial institutions, and government entities. Visa Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Visa Inc.는 미국 및 국제적으로 결제 기술 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 결제 거래의 승인, 청산, 결제를 가능하게 하는 거래 처리 네트워크인 VisaNet을 운영합니다. 이 회사는 신용카드, 직불카드, 선불카드 상품도 제공합니다. 탭투페이(tap to pay), 토큰화, 클릭투페이(click to pay) 서비스; Visa Direct는 자금 이동을 촉진하여 고객이 네트워크를 통해 자금을 수집, 보유, 전환 및 전송할 수 있도록 하는 플랫폼입니다. 공항 라운지 이용, 식사 예약, 쇼핑 경험, 이벤트 티켓, 판매자 제안 등의 발급 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 전자상거래 플랫폼과의 옴니채널 결제 통합인 수용 솔루션을 제공합니다. 위험 감지 및 예방 솔루션; 컨설팅 실무, 독점 분석 모델, 데이터 과학자 및 경제학자, 마케팅 서비스, 관리 서비스로 구성된 자문 및 기타 서비스. 회사는 Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink 및 PLUS 브랜드로 서비스를 제공합니다. 소비자, 판매자, 금융 기관 및 정부 기관에 서비스를 제공합니다. Visa Inc.는 1958년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아 주 샌프란시스코에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":426.18,"mcap":795166638080.0,"pe":34.592533,"fpe":24.86405,"peg":1.9261,"ps":17.32276,"pb":22.235092,"ev_ebitda":24.773,"div":0.73,"beta":0.786,"hi52":442.23,"lo52":293.89},"fin":{"rev":45902999552.0,"rev_g":0.132,"eps_g":0.219,"gross":0.97678,"op":0.66306996,"net":0.51203996,"roe":0.63507,"fcf":20983375872.0,"cash":14083000320.0,"debt":22954999808.0,"de":63.568,"eps":12.32,"feps":17.14041},"own":{"short":0.0124,"inst":0.89322,"insider":0.00086000003},"analyst":{"n":37,"mean":449.06433,"median":455.0,"high":500.0,"low":330.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.5,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":9,"buy":26,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":9,"buy":27,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":9,"buy":27,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":9,"buy":27,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":486.0,"priorPriceTarget":475.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":490.0,"priorPriceTarget":440.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":470.0,"priorPriceTarget":443.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":500.0,"priorPriceTarget":445.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Macquarie","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":465.0,"priorPriceTarget":420.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overwei